    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Seven days. Seven missions. One final CTF. Learn cybersecurity from zero through practical labs, challenges, expert content, and exciting rewards &mdash; completely free.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>About Cyber Week</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Still wondering whether cybersecurity is the right career for you?</li>\n<li>Stop guessing.</li>\n<li>HackoSquad Cyber Week 2026 is a free, seven-day online cybersecurity experience created for complete beginners, students, and anyone ready to explore a career in cybersecurity.</li>\n<li>From 19&ndash;26 September 2026, you will learn essential cybersecurity concepts, complete practical missions, explore real attack and defense scenarios, and compete in a final Capture the Flag challenge.</li>\n<li>No previous cybersecurity experience is required.</li>\n<li>You only need curiosity, consistency, and the courage to try.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why You Should Join</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Learn cybersecurity from the beginning</li>\n<li>Complete seven practical missions in seven days</li>\n<li>Experience beginner-friendly cybersecurity labs</li>\n<li>Safely hack your first practice website</li>\n<li>Learn to identify and investigate attacks</li>\n<li>Explore both offensive and defensive security</li>\n<li>Discover which cybersecurity career path suits you</li>\n<li>Compete in the final live CTF</li>\n<li>Win prizes, vouchers, coupons, and partner rewards</li>\n<li>Earn a certificate after meeting the completion requirements</li>\n<li>Showcase a useful project, tool, script, or research work</li>\n<li>Learn through content contributed by cybersecurity partners</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Project Showcase</strong></p>\n<p>Built a project, tool, script, or research work that deserves an audience?</p>\n<p>Apply for the Cyber Week Creator Spotlight.</p>\n<p>Selected creators will receive an opportunity to present their work to the HackoSquad community during the event. Your next user, supporter, collaborator, or opportunity could be watching.</p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to participants worldwide</li>\n<li>College students, freshers, professionals, and school students may apply</li>\n<li>Complete beginners are welcome</li>\n<li>No previous cybersecurity experience is required</li>\n<li>Participation is free</li>\n<li>Participants may register individually or in teams of up to two</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Everyone who completes Cyber Week will receive a guaranteed reward, including an exclusive voucher or prize. No one walks away empty-handed.</p>\n<p><strong>Skills You Will Explore</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cybersecurity Fundamentals</li>\n<li>Ethical Hacking</li>\n<li>Web Security</li>\n<li>Network Security</li>\n<li>Linux Basics</li>\n<li>Threat Detection</li>\n<li>Incident Response</li>\n<li>Digital Investigation</li>\n<li>Defensive Security</li>\n<li>CTF Problem-Solving</li>\n<li>Analytical Thinking</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Register free and take your first real step into cybersecurity.</p>",
